","راج","الله","بيناتڠ"],"answer_index":2,"explanation":"Nabi Nuh menyeru kaumnya supaya menyembah Allah Yang Esa.","page_ref":"29–30"},{"question_id":"S4P2Q08","unit_code":"sirah_t4_p2","mission":2,"difficulty":"Asas","prompt":"اڤاكه ڤربواتن ساله قوم نبي نوح؟","choices":["برصدقه","مڽمبه الله","ممبنتو اورڠ","مڽمبه برهالا"],"answer_index":3,"explanation":"Antara berhala yang disembah ialah Wadd, Suwa‘, Yaghuth, Ya‘uq dan Nasr.","page_ref":"29–30"},{"question_id":"S4P2Q09","unit_code":"sirah_t4_p2","mission":2,"difficulty":"Faham","prompt":"باڬايمانا سيكڤ نبي نوح كتيك دعوه دتولق؟","choices":["تتڤ صابر","مڠهينا قوم","برهنتي دعوه","مڽراهن"],"answer_index":0,"explanation":"Ramai kaumnya menolak seruan Nabi Nuh, namun baginda terus bersabar.","page_ref":"30–32"},{"question_id":"S4P2Q10","unit_code":"sirah_t4_p2","mission":2,"difficulty":"Faham","prompt":"اڤاكه يڠ ديبينا اوليه نبي نوح؟","choices":["استان","باهترا","منارا","ڤاسر"],"answer_index":1,"explanation":"Allah memerintahkan Nabi Nuh membina bahtera sebagai persediaan menghadapi banjir.","page_ref":"32–34"},{"question_id":"S4P2Q11","unit_code":"sirah_t4_p2","mission":2,"difficulty":"Aplikasi","prompt":"اڤاكه يڠ برلاكو ڤد زمان نبي نوح؟","choices":["کمراو ڤنجڠ","ݢمڤا بومي","بنجير بسر","ڤڽاكيت"],"answer_index":2,"explanation":"Banjir besar berlaku selepas Nabi Nuh berdakwah dengan penuh kesabaran.","page_ref":"33–34"},{"question_id":"S4P2Q12","unit_code":"sirah_t4_p2","mission":2,"difficulty":"Aplikasi","prompt":"سياڤاكه يڠ دسلامتكن دالم بهاݢترا؟","choices":["قوم يڠ منچچا","سموا ڤڽمبه برهالا","فرعون","نبي نوح دان اورڠ برايمن"],"answer_index":3,"explanation":"Nabi Nuh dan orang beriman diselamatkan di dalam bahtera.","page_ref":"34"},{"question_id":"S4P2Q13","unit_code":"sirah_t4_p2","mission":3,"difficulty":"Asas","prompt":"اڤاكه يڠ دسمبه اوليه قوم نبي إبراهيم؟","choices":["برهالا","الله سهاج","ملايكت","كتاب"],"answer_index":0,"explanation":"Kaum Nabi Ibrahim menyembah berhala, sedangkan baginda mengajak mereka mentauhidkan Allah.","page_ref":"35–37"},{"question_id":"S4P2Q14","unit_code":"sirah_t4_p2","mission":3,"difficulty":"Asas","prompt":"كڤد سياڤاكه نبي إبراهيم منڽرو قومڽ برعباده؟","choices":["منوسي","الله","بتو","ماتاهاري"],"answer_index":1,"explanation":"Nabi Ibrahim mengajak kaumnya meninggalkan berhala dan menyembah Allah.","page_ref":"35–39"},{"question_id":"S4P2Q15","unit_code":"sirah_t4_p2","mission":3,"difficulty":"Faham","prompt":"اڤاكه يڠ دلاكوكـن نبي إبراهيم كڤد برهالا؟","choices":["مڽيمڤنڽ","مڽمبهڽ","ممهـنچوركنڽ","منجوالڽ"],"answer_index":2,"explanation":"Nabi Ibrahim menghancurkan berhala-berhala untuk menyedarkan kaumnya.","page_ref":"39–40"},{"question_id":"S4P2Q16","unit_code":"sirah_t4_p2","mission":3,"difficulty":"Faham","prompt":"دڠن اڤاكه قوم نبي إبراهيم ماهو مڠهوقوم بلياو؟","choices":["اير","اڠين","ڤاسير","اڤي"],"answer_index":3,"explanation":"Kaumnya mahu membakar Nabi Ibrahim kerana menentang berhala.","page_ref":"40–41"},{"question_id":"S4P2Q17","unit_code":"sirah_t4_p2","mission":3,"difficulty":"Aplikasi","prompt":"اڤاكه يڠ الله جاديكن كڤد اڤي؟","choices":["سجوک دان سلامت","لبـيه ڤانس","اد ڤتر","مڠهيلڠ"],"answer_index":0,"explanation":"Dengan kuasa Allah, api menjadi sejuk dan selamat bagi Nabi Ibrahim.","page_ref":"41–42"},{"question_id":"S4P2Q18","unit_code":"sirah_t4_p2","mission":3,"difficulty":"Aplikasi","prompt":"اڤاكه سيفت نبي إبراهيم يڠ واجب دچونتوهي؟","choices":["ڤناکوت","براني دان برايمن","سومبوڠ","ڤوتوس اسا"],"answer_index":1,"explanation":"Nabi Ibrahim berani dan teguh beriman walaupun ditentang.","page_ref":"41–42"},{"question_id":"S4P2Q19","unit_code":"sirah_t4_p2","mission":4,"difficulty":"Asas","prompt":"سياڤاكه يڠ برسام هاجر د ليمبه تندوس؟","choices":["نبي نوح","نبي عيسى","إسماعيل","فرعون"],"answer_index":2,"explanation":"Menurut buku teks, Nabi Ibrahim meninggalkan Hajar dan Ismail di kawasan yang tandus dengan perintah Allah.","page_ref":"43"},{"question_id":"S4P2Q20","unit_code":"sirah_t4_p2","mission":4,"difficulty":"Asas","prompt":"اڤاكه سيفت ترڤوجي هاجر؟","choices":["سومبوڠ","مڠهينا","منولق اوسها","توكل"],"answer_index":3,"explanation":"Hajar tetap bertawakal kepada Allah ketika berada di kawasan tandus.","page_ref":"43–44"},{"question_id":"S4P2Q21","unit_code":"sirah_t4_p2","mission":4,"difficulty":"Faham","prompt":"انتارا دوا بوكيت ماناكه هاجر برولڠ اليق؟","choices":["صفا دان مروة","احد دان ثور","سيناء دان عرفات","نور دان هيرا"],"answer_index":0,"explanation":"Hajar berusaha mencari air dengan bergerak antara Safa dan Marwah.","page_ref":"44"},{"question_id":"S4P2Q22","unit_code":"sirah_t4_p2","mission":4,"difficulty":"Faham","prompt":"اڤاكه نام اير يڠ دكورنياكن الله؟","choices":["اير لاوت","اير زمزم","اير هوجن","اير سوڠاي"],"answer_index":1,"explanation":"Air Zamzam muncul dengan izin Allah ketika Hajar mencari air untuk Ismail.","page_ref":"44–45"},{"question_id":"S4P2Q23","unit_code":"sirah_t4_p2","mission":4,"difficulty":"Aplikasi","prompt":"اڤاكه ڤڠاجرن درڤد اوسها هاجر؟","choices":["تيدق ڤرلو منچاري","منونڠ سهاج","اوسها دان توكل","برتيڠكه"],"answer_index":2,"explanation":"Kisah Hajar mengajar kita berusaha sambil bertawakal kepada Allah.","page_ref":"44–45"},{"question_id":"S4P2Q24","unit_code":"sirah_t4_p2","mission":4,"difficulty":"Aplikasi","prompt":"عملن اڤاكه مڠيڠتكن كسه صفا دان مروة؟","choices":["زكاة","اذان","اعتكاف","سعي"],"answer_index":3,"explanation":"Peristiwa Safa dan Marwah menjadi pengajaran yang dikaitkan dengan amalan saie dalam haji.","page_ref":"44–45"},{"question_id":"S4P2Q25","unit_code":"sirah_t4_p2","mission":5,"difficulty":"Asas","prompt":"سياڤاكه ڤمرينته ظالم ڤد زمان نبي موسى؟","choices":["فرعون","نمرود","جالوت","قارون"],"answer_index":0,"explanation":"Nabi Musa hidup pada zaman pemerintahan Firaun.","page_ref":"46–47"},{"question_id":"S4P2Q26","unit_code":"sirah_t4_p2","mission":5,"difficulty":"Asas","prompt":"د سوڠاي ماناكه بايي موسى دهاڽوتكن؟","choices":["سوڠاي ڤاهڠ","سوڠاي نيل","سوڠاي كينتاباتڠن","سوڠاي ڤيراق"],"answer_index":1,"explanation":"Bayi Musa diletakkan di dalam bekas di Sungai Nil bagi menyelamatkannya daripada Firaun.","page_ref":"47–49"},{"question_id":"S4P2Q27","unit_code":"sirah_t4_p2","mission":5,"difficulty":"Faham","prompt":"د ماناكه نبي موسى ممبسر؟","choices":["ڤاسر","ڬوا","ايستان فرعون","ڤولاو"],"answer_index":2,"explanation":"Dengan aturan Allah, Nabi Musa dibesarkan di istana Firaun.","page_ref":"48–50"},{"question_id":"S4P2Q28","unit_code":"sirah_t4_p2","mission":5,"difficulty":"Faham","prompt":"اڤاكه دعوه اوتام نبي موسى كڤد فرعون؟","choices":["مڽمبه برهالا","منجاديكن فرعون توهن","منچاري هرتا","برايمن كڤد الله"],"answer_index":3,"explanation":"Nabi Musa menyampaikan seruan Allah kepada Firaun dengan berani.","page_ref":"52–54"},{"question_id":"S4P2Q29","unit_code":"sirah_t4_p2","mission":5,"difficulty":"Aplikasi","prompt":"سياڤاكه قوم يڠ ديڤيمڤين اوليه نبي موسى؟","choices":["بني إسرائيل","قوم عاد","قوم ثمود","قوم نبي نوح"],"answer_index":0,"explanation":"Allah menolong Nabi Musa dan Bani Israel melarikan diri daripada penindasan Firaun.","page_ref":"54–56"},{"question_id":"S4P2Q30","unit_code":"sirah_t4_p2","mission":5,"difficulty":"Aplikasi","prompt":"اڤاكه معجزه نبي موسى كتيك دكجر فرعون؟","choices":["مڠوبت ڤساكيت","ممبله لاوت","مڠهيدوڤكن اورڠ ماتي","مڠورونكن هوجن"],"answer_index":1,"explanation":"Allah membelah laut sebagai mukjizat bagi menyelamatkan Nabi Musa dan Bani Israel.","page_ref":"55–56"},{"question_id":"S4P2Q31","unit_code":"sirah_t4_p2","mission":6,"difficulty":"Asas","prompt":"سياڤاكه ايبو نبي عيسى؟","choices":["هاجر","اسيه","مريم","خديجه"],"answer_index":2,"explanation":"Maryam ialah ibu kepada Nabi Isa.","page_ref":"57–60"},{"question_id":"S4P2Q32","unit_code":"sirah_t4_p2","mission":6,"difficulty":"Asas","prompt":"باڬايمانا نبي عيسى دلاهيركن؟","choices":["دالم بهاݢترا","د ايستان","د ڤادڠ ڤاسير","تنڤا باڤا"],"answer_index":3,"explanation":"Dengan kekuasaan Allah, Nabi Isa dilahirkan oleh Maryam tanpa bapa.","page_ref":"59–61"},{"question_id":"S4P2Q33","unit_code":"sirah_t4_p2","mission":6,"difficulty":"Faham","prompt":"اڤاكه معجزه نبي عيسى سواكتو بايي؟","choices":["برچاكڤ","ممبله لاوت","ممبينا بهاݢترا","ممرچيه برهالا"],"answer_index":0,"explanation":"Nabi Isa dapat berbicara semasa bayi sebagai salah satu mukjizat daripada Allah.","page_ref":"60–62"},{"question_id":"S4P2Q34","unit_code":"sirah_t4_p2","mission":6,"difficulty":"Faham","prompt":"اڤاكه نام كتاب يڠ دتورونكن كڤد نبي عيسى؟","choices":["توراة","انجيل","زبور","صحف"],"answer_index":1,"explanation":"Nabi Isa menerima kitab Injil sebagai wahyu daripada Allah.","page_ref":"62–64"},{"question_id":"S4P2Q35","unit_code":"sirah_t4_p2","mission":6,"difficulty":"Aplikasi","prompt":"دڠن ايزين سياڤاكه معجزه نبي عيسى برلاكو؟","choices":["فرعون","مريم","الله","راج"],"answer_index":2,"explanation":"Mukjizat Nabi Isa berlaku dengan izin Allah, bukannya kuasa baginda sendiri.","page_ref":"63–65"},{"question_id":"S4P2Q36","unit_code":"sirah_t4_p2","mission":6,"difficulty":"Aplikasi","prompt":"اڤاكه يڠ برلاكو كڤد نبي عيسى منوروت عقيدة اسلام؟","choices":["دبونوه موسوه","تروه هيلڠ","دبakar","دسلامتكن دان دڠكت الله"],"answer_index":3,"explanation":"Menurut kisah buku teks dan ayat al-Quran yang dipetik, Nabi Isa tidak dibunuh dan Allah mengangkat baginda.","page_ref":"65–69"}]$sirahq$::jsonb) AS j(question_id text,unit_code text,mission integer,difficulty text,prompt text,choices jsonb,answer_index integer,explanation text,page_ref text)
